  "content": "\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">關於模組包：</span></strong></p>\n<p>本模組包用於 TasteTheSno 的《咒術迴戰 x 奇幻 Minecraft》100 天挑戰模組包。它將 Orca 的「咒術工藝」模組與多種不同奇幻主題的模組相結合，提供內容豐富的冒險體驗。本模組包的核心重點在於透過「咒術」模組所能獲得的角色與能力，讓您能對抗世界中的奇幻生物。</p>\n<p><strong>我與朋友遊玩時使用的伺服器主機（輸入代碼 SNO 可享首月 8 折優惠）：</strong><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://wepwawet.net/p/sno\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://wepwawet.net/p/sno</a></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>我的影片：</strong></span><br><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ohz8mVxCvjc?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>包含的模組（1.16.5 版本）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advancement-plaques\" rel=\"nofollow\">進度銘牌 [Forge] (by Grend_G)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/skin-layers-3d\" rel=\"nofollow\">3D 皮膚層 (Fabric/Forge) (by tr7zw)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/shaders/complementary-reimagined\" rel=\"nofollow\">互補陰影 - 重塑版 (by EminGTR)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" rel=\"nofollow\">飾品 API (Forge) (by TheIllusiveC4)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/villager-names\" rel=\"nofollow\">村民名稱 (by Serilum)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mouse-tweaks\" rel=\"nofollow\">滑鼠微調 (by YaLTeR)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-and-fire-dragons\" rel=\"nofollow\">冰與火：龍 (by sbom_xela)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's API (Forge) (by YUNGNICKYOUNG)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">布料設定 API (Fabric/Forge) (by shedaniel)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/supplementaries\" rel=\"nofollow\">補充要素 (by MehVahdJukaar)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/replay-mod-for-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">回放模組 for Forge (by leocraft6)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/shaders/complementary-unbound\" rel=\"nofollow\">互補陰影 - 無限版 (by EminGTR)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bookshelf\" rel=\"nofollow\">書架 (by DarkhaxDev)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/caves-and-cliffs-backport\" rel=\"nofollow\">洞穴與山崖 回溯模組 (by blackgear27)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/brutal-bosses-dungeon\" rel=\"nofollow\">殘酷首領 - 自訂首領 [Forge/Fabric] (by someaddon)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/natures-compass\" rel=\"nofollow\">自然羅盤 (by Chaosyr)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/human-companions\" rel=\"nofollow\">人類夥伴 (by jus10wontons)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" rel=\"nofollow\">集體輔助模組 (by Serilum)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/charm-of-undying\" rel=\"nofollow\">不死護符 (Fabric/Forge/Quilt) (by TheIllusiveC4)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/selene\" rel=\"nofollow\">月光庫 (by MehVahdJukaar)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-resources-jer\" rel=\"nofollow\">足夠資源 (JER) (by way2muchnoise)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/neat\" rel=\"nofollow\">簡潔血條 (by Vazkii)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ai-improvements\" rel=\"nofollow\">AI 改進 (by QueenOfMissiles)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-better-dungeons\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's 更佳地下城 (Forge) (by YUNGNICKYOUNG)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/iceberg\" rel=\"nof